    HttpServer request bodies: text is decoded by the rules shared by all HTTP clients and servers (see
    get_http_body_encoding()) whether the body is read from the socket of a synchronous HTTP/1.1 listener, buffered by
    the asynchronous I/O layer, or received over HTTP/2, with the default text encoding of the server as the assumed
    encoding
